 $。\n6. **一旦成功匹配所有和，就得到答案**（题目保证唯一解）。\n\n---\n\n### ✅ 示例\n\n**输入：**\n```\n6\n4 5 7 10 12 13\n```\n\n- $ M = 6 \\Rightarrow N = 4 $\n- sums[0] = 4 → $ a_1 + a_2 $\n- sums[1] = 5 → $ a_1 + a_3 $\n- 尝试 sums[2] = 7 作为 $ a_2 + a_3 $:\n  - $ a_1 = (4 + 5 - 7)/2 = 1 $\n  - $ a_2 = 3, a_3 = 4 $\n- 当前数组 [1,3,4]，生成和：4,5,7 → 匹配\n- 剩余和：10,12,13\n- 下一个数 $ a_4 $：最小剩余和是 10 = 1 + a_4 → $ a_4 = 9 $\n- 新增和：1+9=10, 3+9=12, 4+9=13 → 全部匹配\n- **输出：1 3 4 9**\n\n---\n\n### 💡 实现建议（Python）\n\n- 使用 `Counter` 来维护可用的和。\n- 每次尝试一个候选 $ a_2 + a_3 $，进行模拟还原。\n- 一旦成功，立即返回结果。\n\n---\n\n如需具体代码实现，请告诉我！", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": null, "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": null}}, {"type": "human", "data": {"content": "Gizilch这道题", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": null}}, {"type": "ai", "data": {"content": "暂无相关信息", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": null, "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": null}}, {"type": "human", "data": {"content": "The game of gizilch has very simple rules这道题", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": null}}, {"type": "ai", "data": {"content": "暂无相关信息", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": null, "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": null}}]